        "created_at": "2026-11-08T03:58:01.007Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Businesses everywhere are replacing repetitive manual work with smart, connected workflows. This 12-week online internship teaches you how to build them.<br>\nWhat you will work on:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>n8n</strong> (run locally with Docker): workflows, webhooks, schedules, AI agents</li>\n<li><strong>Make</strong> and <strong>Zapier</strong>: visual automation and integrations</li>\n<li><strong>GEMINI AI</strong>, APIs and webhooks</li>\n<li>Real business scenarios: lead capture, invoice data extraction, HR screening, order and inventory sync, reporting and chatbots</li>\n<li>A final capstone project for your portfolio<br>\nHow it works:</li>\n<li>24 industry-style tasks with a detailed guide for each one</li>\n<li>Self-paced, with monthly deadlines (no live mentorship)</li>\n<li>Free tools and free APIs, so no software costs</li>\n<li>Official MRS certificate on successful completion<br>\nFee: Rs. 5,000 (one time) | Seats: only 25<br>\nOpen to students, beginners, freelancers and career switchers. No coding experience required.<br>\nLast date to apply: 15 November2026<br>\nApply here: <strong><a href=\"https://mrsplatform.tech/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://mrsplatform.tech/</a></strong><br>\nFollow MRS for updates: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/mrs-official/home/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.linkedin.com/company/mrs-official/home/</a><br>\n<strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#MRS</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#MuslimReviveSkills</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#AIAutomation</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#WorkflowAutomation</span></strong> <strong><a class=\"hashtag-cooked\" href=\"/tag/n8n/417\" data-type=\"tag\" data-slug=\"n8n\" data-id=\"417\" data-style-type=\"icon\" data-icon=\"tag\"><span class=\"hashtag-icon-placeholder\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-square-full svg-icon svg-node\"><use href=\"#square-full\"></use></svg></span><span>n8n</span></a></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#MakeCom</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#Zapier</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#NoCode</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#AutomationInternship</span></strong> <strong><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#OnlineInternship</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/original/3X/9/b/9be88d9467c546f3bb7a85b64a535d4ee62af4e8.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/mfefx0sx1wHIYxcWfGkL7AfiBC0.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"AI &amp; Workflow Automation Internship\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/9/b/9be88d9467c546f3bb7a85b64a535d4ee62af4e8_2_500x500.jpeg\" alt=\"AI &amp; Workflow Automation Internship\" data-base62-sha1=\"mfefx0sx1wHIYxcWfGkL7AfiBC0\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/9/b/9be88d9467c546f3bb7a85b64a535d4ee62af4e8_2_500x500.jpeg, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/9/b/9be88d9467c546f3bb7a85b64a535d4ee62af4e8_2_750x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/9/b/9be88d9467c546f3bb7a85b64a535d4ee62af4e8_2_1000x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D4C4DE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">AI &amp; Workflow Automation Internship</span><span class=\"informations\">1254×1254 314 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><small><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/information_source.png?v=16\" title=\":information_source:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":information_source:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Replies are closed - contact the author using email, application